    description: Some("Humphrey wakes in the hold of a Zak zoo ship and has to work his way forward to the escape pod in its nose. The Zaks breathe chlorine, so his suit never comes off — and every sharp edge he brushes punctures it and bleeds away air, making the whole isometric ship a matter of conserving what he has left."),
